Notes from a multilingual layout and PDF accessibility desk in Berlin.

I'm Onur, and I run [DTP Services Berlin](https://dtp-services.de): layout in many languages and accessible PDFs, from Arabic to Japanese, InDesign to PDF/UA. This is where I write down what happens at the desk. The file that looked fine and wasn't. The checker that said pass. The fix that took ten minutes after a day of looking. Client names stay out; the know-how stays in.

